    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italian Brain Rot Simulator is a chaotic PvP card game where logic goes to die and nonsense reigns supreme. Build your deck from a growing collection of bizarre, iconic, and possibly cursed characters, then face off against other players in matches where anything can happen \u2014 and probably will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft ridiculous combos, fuse creatures that were never meant to exist, and upgrade your cards to unlock even dumber powers. The more unhinged your deck becomes, the more powerful (and rotten) you grow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about balance. This is about trallallero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Absurd card creation \u2013 Mix and match to make wildly unpredictable synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online PvP chaos \u2013 Battle friends and strangers in matches that rarely make sense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade everything \u2013 Improve your cards in questionable ways to keep the nonsense going.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rot-fueled progression \u2013 The more you rot, the more you unlock.</p></li></ul>",
